      subtitle="Aug 2023 - Dec 2023 at UMRF Ventures, Memphis, TN"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1">
        <li>Reviewed SOC 2 Type 2 reports and SIG questionnaires, corresponding with external vendors to confirm control coverage and writing findings up for other business units</li>
        <li>Created and secured user roles, entitlements, and group access in Active Directory, Active Roles, and SailPoint IdentityIQ, and coordinated remediation with the teams that owned the affected systems</li>
        <li>Worked a live ServiceNow queue against service-level expectations, led L1 and L2 shifts with ticket quality review, and took escalated L3 issues</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="Studio Manager / Instructor"
      subtitle="Sep 2020 - Jan 2023 at Summer Ave. Art & Clay, Memphis, TN"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1">
        <li>Managed day to day operations of a ceramics studio, and built and taught pottery classes for students from beginner through advanced</li>
        <li>Mixed glazes from raw materials and handled wheel and kiln maintenance and repair</li>
        <li>Automated business operations by integrating Square POS with Google Calendar and Contacts using Zapier and Integromat; built Excel tools to streamline ordering</li>
        <li>Implemented SEO improvements, Google Analytics, and social media integrations; managed the website and newsletter</li>
      </ul>
      <a href={`${base}pottery/`} class="btn btn-outline btn-sm border-accent text-accent hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-content hover:border-accent transition-colors gap-2 mt-3 no-underline">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"></circle><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"></polyline></svg>
        See my pottery
      </a>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <!-- Homelab Section -->
  <div class="bg-base-300 rounded-lg p-6 mb-10">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span>🖥️</span> Homelab & Lab Infrastructure
    </h3>
    <p class="mb-4">Self-directed infrastructure lab for hands-on learning and experimentation with enterprise technologies:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1">
      <li>Run a small Splunk lab with dashboards and alerts built against it</li>
      <li>Run a small Windows Server and Active Directory lab</li>
      <li>Built multi-node Proxmox cluster hosting Linux containers and VMs</li>
      <li>Configured OPNsense for secure dual-stack network with firewall, VLANs, and VPN</li>
      <li>Implemented backup strategy using NAS and Backblaze B2</li>
      <li>Manage DNS, TLS certificates (Certbot), and WAF through Cloudflare</li>
      <li>Automate patching and system administration across hosts using Ansible</li>
      <li>Running NixOS as daily driver with Nix Flakes for fully declarative and reproducible system configuration</li>
      <li>Automated Nix flake updates and package version checks via GitHub Actions</li>
      <li>Built custom Nix packages and configured CI/CD to publish sanitized public version of NixOS configs and dotfiles</li>
      <li>Created comprehensive documentation and network diagrams for all infrastructure</li>
      <li>Presented on reproducible cybersecurity labs at a regional security meetup, and presenting on the topic again at the BSides Memphis Linux village</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <h2 class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Splunk</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 grid gap-1">
        <li>Enterprise Security Certified Admin</li>
        <li>Certified Cybersecurity Defense Analyst</li>
        <li>Accredited Security SE I (Partner)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">AWS</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 grid gap-1">
        <li>Certified Solutions Architect - Associate</li>
        <li>Certified Cloud Practitioner</li>
        <li>Partner Sales Accreditation</li>
        <li>Cloud Economics Essentials</li>
        <li>Generative AI Essentials</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Red Hat</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 grid gap-1">
        <li>RHEL Technical Seller</li>
        <li>Ansible Automation Platform Technical Seller</li>
        <li>OpenShift Technical Seller</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Security & Infrastructure</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 grid gap-1">
        <li>Zscaler Certified Sales Engineer</li>
        <li>Cato Certified Associate</li>
        <li>Pure Storage FlashArray Architect Associate</li>
        <li>Cohesity Data Cloud Technical Sales Associate</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10">
    <a href="https://www.credly.com/users/john-dorion.c2a33719/badges" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline border-primary text-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-content hover:border-primary transition-colors btn-sm">
      View All Badges on Credly
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <h2 class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Security Operations & Detection</h4>
      <p class="text-sm">Splunk Cloud, Splunk Enterprise, Splunk Enterprise Security, SPL, CrowdStrike Falcon EDR, MITRE ATT&CK, detection development, alert triage and tuning, false positive reduction, correlation searches, dashboards and scheduled reporting, investigation timelines, escalation procedures</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Data Protection & Identity</h4>
      <p class="text-sm">DLP concepts and exfiltration detection by file and device type, data classification, sensitive data handling, data retention, least privilege, Active Directory, Active Roles, SailPoint IdentityIQ, entitlement and access review, DNS, SPF, DKIM, DMARC, Google Workspace administration</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Cloud & Infrastructure</h4>
      <p class="text-sm">AWS, GCP, Linux (various distros), Windows, containers and virtualization (Proxmox, LXC, NixOS), networking (VLANs, VPN, DNS, TLS), Cloudflare, OPNsense, backup and recovery</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Engineering & Automation</h4>
      <p class="text-sm">Python, PowerShell, Bash, REST APIs, Ansible, Git, source control and peer review, change control, machine learning applied to security log analysis, generative AI data-leakage risk research</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold mb-2">Governance & Delivery</h4>
      <p class="text-sm">SOC 2 Type 2 and SIG review, vendor risk, ServiceNow ticketing, Agile and SAFe PI planning, requirements gathering, stakeholder workshops, SharePoint knowledge management</p>
